30,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It takes much longer than we think—over an hour for kitchen and bathroom combined. Plus, our definitions of ""done"" are completely different.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The usage is very uneven; a few people do almost all the cooking. Also, some of us are away for weeks at a time.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The bathroom gets dirty again in less than two weeks! And Minako is right, some people just wipe the basin and call it a day.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"We are wasting money buying the same sprays twice, and the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour for a cleaner.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Our arguments always start with reminders about chores. Interestingly, the previous tenants tried permanent assignments and ended up barely speaking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if some people are barely here, it's unfair for them to have the same workload as those of us always present.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. The current ""informal"" way ignores that a few people create most of the mess in the kitchen.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, if we don't agree on what ""done"" means, it doesn't matter who does it; it'll still be grim.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Servas, it sounds like we must be very careful not to let the chores ruin our friendship.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Shizue. We need a solution that prevents the ""reminder"" cycle that leads to those rows.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minako,,"If the time commitment is high, maybe we should consider if we can actually afford the time to do it ourselves.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A rota might be unfair if you're away for a month but still have to ""catch up"" or pay for someone else.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I just want a standard! I can't stand the bathroom getting black spots so quickly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A professional cleaner is expensive, but it would stop the confusion over who bought the supplies and who cleaned what.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, a professional might be the only way to ensure the standard is the same every single time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
