55,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A is a rota, B is a paid service, and C is permanent assignments. I'm leaning toward B to save us time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Given the uneven usage and absences, Option A feels unfair. Option C is too rigid. I prefer B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I hate the guessing game. Option B means it's always clean, and we don't fight about the grout!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B is pricey, but it solves the ""out of pocket"" issue if we settle the invoice monthly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Servas,,Servas here. Option C is dangerous—the previous tenants stopped talking. Option A leads to reminders and rows. B is the most peaceful.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, do you think the cost is manageable if we split it five ways?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It's a logical trade-off. We pay money to buy back our time and our peace of mind.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm totally for B! No more bracing myself before entering the bathroom.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a bit expensive, but the harmony of the house is worth more than a few thousand yen.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Servas,,I agree. Let's choose the path that keeps us smiling at each other.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minako,,"I'll vote for B. It removes the burden of the ""full pass"" timing from our shoulders.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'm voting B. It's the only way to neutralize the usage imbalance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Sakura,,B for me! Yay for a clean house!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also vote for B. It's the clearest way to handle the finances.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote B. Let's preserve our friendship.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
